# Spec Kit (specs-only repo, has its own .git — never committed here)
# Anchored with a leading slash so only the top-level specs/ is ignored.
# specs/ holds its own .git, so an unanchored pattern would also hide
# specs/*/source code; the slash keeps the app's source tree visible.
/specs/

